\par d) Th\'b5nh l\'cbp ph\'ad\'eang Tr\'ad\'eang Th\'denh tr\'aan c\'ac s\'eb to\'b5n b\'e9 di\'d6n t\'ddch t\'f9 nhi\'aan v\'b5 d\'a9n s\'e8 c\'f1a x\'b7 Tr\'ad\'eang Th\'denh.
